      \begin{itemize}
        \item[(0)] There is a copy of the coweight $cw \equiv 0 \, (4)$ piece of $\text{Ext}_{\euscr{A}(1)^\vee_\mathbb{R}}(\mathbb{M}_2^\mathbb{R})$ (see \cref{R-Ext(M_2) cw=0}) with generator $x_0$ in degree $(s,f,w)$ called a \textit{flag};
