\section{Methodology}\label{sec:methods}

In this section, we first introduce three baselines for tombstone parsing. Then we describe our proposed framework, \textbf{Tomb2Meaning (T2M)}, with detailed discussion on the integration of retrieval-augmentation techniques at different stages in the pipeline.

