\textit{Let $\alpha$ and $\beta$ be full text sentences. In this paper, we consider only factoid sentences that can at most represent existentials, expressing the omission of knowledge to, at some point, be injected with new, relevant information. $\tau$ represents a transformation function, in which the vector and logical representations are denoted as $\tau(\alpha)=A$ and $\tau(\beta)=B$ for $\alpha$ and $\beta$, respectively.}




