\begin{abstract}
  This work establishes simple criteria for detecting higher rational singularities
  via the intersection Du~Bois complex and the irrationality complex of a normal
  variety over the complex numbers.
  % Moreover, we show the descent of pre-$m$-rationality under finite covers of
  % normal varieties and study their behavior under base change of field extensions.
\end{abstract}

