\begin{theorem}
    The map $\psi:P_1\to P$ constructed in \cref{prop:divide_by_2} is an isomorphism of principally polarized abelian varieties.
\end{theorem}
\begin{proof}
    By construction in \cref{prop:divide_by_2}, the map $\psi$ is an isomorphism of the lattices defining the Prym varieties. By \cref{polarization} it preserves the polarization. Hence it is an isomorphism of principally polarized tropical abelian varieties.
\end{proof}






