Average PL and quark condensate.

Quark condensate defined as:
$$
Q= \frac{\partial f_{U(N)}^{1,2}}{\partial m}
$$
Average PL: 
\begin{eqnarray}\label{crtwi}
    W(1,\mu)  \ = \  W^{\dagger}(1,-\mu)  \ = \  \begin{cases}
			\frac{  \kappa  h \, e^{-\mu}}{1-  b} \ , \
			& h < h_{cr}  \ , \\
		     \kappa  
          g_{MF}\, e^{-\mu} ,  & h_{cr} <  h < 1/h_{cr}    \ , \\
