\item Simulation results demonstrate that the proposed BCD algorithm outperforms the low-complexity Alternating Optimization (AO) algorithm in optimizing the transmission rate. Furthermore, we systematically analyze the impact of various parameters on transmission rate and system regret, and investigate the influence of system load and total delay on the probabilistic delay bound.
