For the Cu region 400 geometric grid points of initial 100\%~Cu concentration are selected such that the density is highest toward the interface with the Cr region. For the Cr region, in the 1~$~\mu m$ layer case, 
50 linear grid points of 100\%~Cr initial concentration are selected, while in the 10~$\mu m~Cr$ layer 100 grid points are selected. The grid configuration is shown in Fig.~\ref{fig:0}.

